  "quest.28D7DBFF0E0A4BB5.quest_desc": [
    "GSPack's own crops (Mystical Customization) for the ores of other mods: Stellaris, The Aether II, EvilCraft, LTX Industries, Occultism, AllTheOres, Just Dire Things and Aquaculture. Many of them are needed for the endgame cores and the Trophy of Infinity. You need the real material first to craft the seed."
